", "duration": 25.95, "size_bytes": 156672, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 91, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/102/en_a1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/102/en_a1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 27.575, "size_bytes": 166464, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 91, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/102/en_a1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/102/en_a1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 23.6, "size_bytes": 142560, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 91, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/102/en_a1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/102/en_a1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 25.35, "size_bytes": 153072, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 91, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/102/en_a1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@6af87068/content/data/versions/1011.json", "paragraphs": ["The show is called Gadio Wave. The team got a chance from Rockstar Games. They played GTA6 and finished it. Then they talked about the game in a new episode.", "The team says GTA6 is very big. They say they cannot finish everything in the game. They also made a video about it on Bilibili.", "The show has no fixed hosts and no fixed time. It shares new games, films and books fast. Many people follow the show."], "paragraphs_zh": ["这档节目叫 Gadio Wave。团队从 Rockstar Games 那里得到了机会。他们玩了《GTA6》并通关了。然后他们在一期新节目里聊了这款游戏。", "团队说《GTA6》非常庞大。他们说游戏里的内容根本玩不完。他们还在 Bilibili 上发布了相关视频。", "这档节目没有固定主持人和固定更新时间。它快速分享新游戏、电影和书。很多人关注这档节目。"], "body": "The show is called Gadio Wave. The team got a chance from Rockstar Games. They played GTA6 and finished it. Then they talked about the game in a new episode.\n\nThe team says GTA6 is very big. They say they cannot finish everything in the game. They also made a video about it on Bilibili.\n\nThe show has no fixed hosts and no fixed time. It shares new games, films and books fast. Many people follow the show.", "body_zh": "这档节目叫 Gadio Wave。团队从 Rockstar Games 那里得到了机会。他们玩了《GTA6》并通关了。然后他们在一期新节目里聊了这款游戏。\n\n团队说《GTA6》非常庞大。他们说游戏里的内容根本玩不完。他们还在 Bilibili 上发布了相关视频。\n\n这档节目没有固定主持人和固定更新时间。它快速分享新游戏、电影和书。很多人关注这档节目。", "text": "The show is called Gadio Wave. The team got a chance from Rockstar Games. They played GTA6 and finished it. Then they talked about the game in a new episode. The team says GTA6 is very big. They say they cannot finish everything in the game. They also made a video about it on Bilibili. The show has no fixed hosts and no fixed time. It shares new games, films and books fast. Many people follow the show.", "vocab": [{"word": "game", "pos": "noun", "zh": "游戏", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "play", "pos": "verb", "zh": "玩", "note": "过去式是 played", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "finish", "pos": "verb", "zh": "完成，通关", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "team", "pos": "noun", "zh": "团队", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "show", "pos": "noun", "zh": "节目", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "big", "pos": "adj", "zh": "大的", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "video", "pos": "noun", "zh": "视频", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "follow", "pos": "verb", "zh": "关注", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-19T02:43:25.218516", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.275, "e": 0.4, "sm": 275, "em": 400, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "show", "s": 0.4, "e": 0.725, "sm": 400, "em": 724, "cs": 4, "ce": 8, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "is", "s": 0.725, "e": 0.875, "sm": 725, "em": 875, "cs": 9, "ce": 11, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "ca